    CS-1: transform route (k=352.62) is the primary TD->LSB source of truth
    
    Make the percept-spectral-repro 'transform' DSP the primary time-domain->LSB
    conversion everywhere, demoting the welch256 x k=269 route to a PSD->LSB
    exploration backup (PI decision 2026-06-27, HANDOFF_TD_LSB_calibration).
    
    analytics.py:
    - LSB_PER_UV2_TRANSFORM = 352.62 (RCS08 all-stim median k; r=0.9927 vs lab repo)
    - LSB_DEPLOYABLE_HZ_HI = 30.0 (device adaptive ceiling; distinct from the 28.3 Hz
      calibration-validity bound, which is untouched)
    - td_transform_band_power(): vectorized transform DSP (strided window matrix ->
      one batched rFFT -> band-mask matmul -> median), byte-identical to the reference
      under non-overlapping windows. No per-window/per-band loop.
    - td_to_lsb() = LSB_PER_UV2_TRANSFORM x band power (primary TD->LSB helper)
    - transform_centered_window(): 30 s rating-centered extent, clip-don't-slide,
      1 s minimum, >10% Missing rejection (the per-PRO contract CS-2 consumes)
    - relabel k=269 block as welch256 PSD->LSB exploration backup; rewrite the stale
      Step-0 verdict to record the supersession
    
    availability.lsb_series psd_modeled tier:
    - convert montage-survey TD via td_to_lsb (transform x352.62), not welch256 x269
    - KEEP source='psd_modeled' tier enum (native-preferred masking + frontend key on
      it); record the DSP route in method instead. Min-samples guard -> one transform
      window.
    
    Tests (202/202 in-container, +6 new):
    - transform reproduces reference DSP bit-for-bit (max err 0.0)
    - td_to_lsb applies 352.62 with 1 s-min + non-positive guards
    - k cancels in Pearson r and AUC (byte-exact) -> the route switch moves displayed
      LSB scale only, never a correlation/AUC result
    - centered-window clip-don't-slide contract; 50%-overlap window count + variance-
      only shift (< 1.26x calibration scatter)
    - native-preferred invariant on the switched lsb_series
    - updated test_lsb_series_psd_modeled_tier_from_montage_td to the transform route

